' A real, ordinary ArcoBASIC program meant to be compiled BY the Fission
' Compiler Substrate's native x86-64 backend (fission/amir/lower_x86_64.abas)
' -- not one of the fission/tests/*.abas fixtures that invoke the substrate
' programmatically, and not fission/tests/substrate_programs/ either (those
' target the bytecode-VM-embedded ArcoCapsule path, a much larger supported
' construct subset than native codegen's own current Phase 1 scope).
'
' fission/tests/native_programs/ is specifically for programs that stay
' within native codegen's own current, much smaller, disclosed subset (see
' lower_x86_64.abas's own header comment: PRINT of a string literal only, for
' now). Expected output: "Hello, native!".
PRINT "Hello, native!"
